<li>Discovery of transient Black Hole Candidates and study of their spectral evolution.</li>
<li>Discovery of weak transients in the galactic ridge.</li>
<li>Detection of cyclotron features in 3 X-ray pulsars: 4U1538-522, V0332+53, and Cep X-4.</li>
<li>Evidence for emission and absorption Fe feature in Seyfert probing reprocessing by cold matter.</li>
<li>Discovery of intense 6-7 keV iron line emission from the galactic center region.</li>
